From 73a4d7cf78f835cad0ab8f0e77c8318fa240c144 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Omer Tuchfeld <omer@tuchfeld.dev>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 14:04:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sfc-controller: DPF_SIM_PORT_TYPE overrides the port
 interface type

A simulated DPU without BlueField hardware runs OVS's kernel datapath,
where the ports the SFC controller adds as type=dpdk never get an ofport.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../controllers/port_type_test.go             | 48 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../serviceinterface_controller.go            | 19 +++++++-
 2 files changed, 66 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 internal/sfccontroller/controllers/port_type_test.go

diff --git a/internal/sfccontroller/controllers/port_type_test.go b/internal/sfccontroller/controllers/port_type_test.go
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..9fbff887
--- /dev/null
+++ b/internal/sfccontroller/controllers/port_type_test.go
@@ -0,0 +1,48 @@
